# CODEOWNERS — GitLab Code Owners (SEC-SUPPLY-01 / SEC-MIG-02, GAP-0882)
#
# Approval ENFORCEMENT is a GitLab project setting, not a file property.
# Required operator action (documented in docs/GAP_ANALYSIS_RESOLVED.md):
#   Settings > Repository > Protected branches > main:
#     - enable "Require approval from code owners"
#   Settings > Merge requests > Approval rules:
#     - add a "Supply chain" rule with approvals required = 2 covering
#       the [Supply chain] section paths below (SEC-SUPPLY-01).

# Supply-chain-sensitive files: dependency pins, CI pipeline, release config.
[Supply chain]
/build.zig.zon @benjiv
/.gitlab-ci.yml @benjiv
/.goreleaser.yaml @benjiv

# GQL migration files and the CI guard that lints them (SEC-MIG-02).
[Migrations]
/migrations/ @benjiv
/scripts/ci/check_migrations.py @benjiv
